{"surface": "event", "title": "The US launches another round of extensive strikes on Iran by May 18, 2027", "html": "<div class=\"ev ws\"><div class=\"evh\"><h2 class=\"title\">The US launches another round of extensive strikes on Iran by May 18, 2027</h2><p class=\"facts\"><span>Any time to May 18, 2027</span><span class=\"sep\">·</span><span class=\"src\">Known from US government confirmation; consensus of major news reporting</span></p><div class=\"hds\"><details class=\"hd\" data-k=\"definition\"><summary>Definition</summary><div class=\"hdb text\"><p>By May 18, 2027 the United States carries out a new round of extensive strikes on Iran, of the kind the New York Times and Israel&#x27;s Channel 12 report Trump is weighing (nuclear facilities, infrastructure, senior officials), as opposed to the limited strikes that have continued through November such as those on Qeshm island. The war began February 28, 2026; ceasefires in April and June broke down in July.</p></div></details><details class=\"hd\" data-k=\"notes\"><summary>Rationale</summary><div class=\"hdb\"><div class=\"note\" data-k=\"note:46\" data-note=\"note:46\"><div class=\"md\" data-md=\"If the US goes 14 days without striking Iran starting by Dec 31 (Polymarket puts that near 0.71), the low-level exchange has cooled and Trump&#x27;s Nov 8 line holds: restarting the war is &#x27;highly unlikely&#x27; if talks produce a strong agreement. Ceasefires in April and June both broke down within weeks, so a pause still leaves about one chance in five of an extensive round by May.\"><p>If the US goes 14 days without striking Iran starting by Dec 31 (Polymarket puts that near 0.71), the low-level exchange has cooled and Trump&#x27;s Nov 8 line holds: restarting the war is &#x27;highly unlikely&#x27; if talks produce a strong agreement. Ceasefires in April and June both broke down within weeks, so a pause still leaves about one chance in five of an extensive round by May.</p></div></div><div class=\"note\" data-k=\"note:47\" data-note=\"note:47\"><div class=\"md\" data-md=\"If US strikes continue through December with no 14-day pause, the flare-up Rabobank describes (&#x27;ships are still being attacked and President Trump is yet again considering plans for another round of extensive strikes&#x27;) has not cooled, and Israel is pressing for action against Iran&#x27;s rebuilt missile stock. An extensive round by May is then about even.\"><p>If US strikes continue through December with no 14-day pause, the flare-up Rabobank describes (&#x27;ships are still being attacked and President Trump is yet again considering plans for another round of extensive strikes&#x27;) has not cooled, and Israel is pressing for action against Iran&#x27;s rebuilt missile stock. An extensive round by May is then about even.</p></div></div><h4 class=\"ev-k\">Evidence</h4><div class=\"basis\"><p class=\"src\"><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"src:162\">energyconnects.com</a></p><blockquote class=\"q\"><a class=\"go quote\" data-go=\"x:passage:src:162:68094c226def\">Global benchmark Brent has retreated by more than a fifth so far this month, as supplies from the Middle East recovered and Trump held off on renewed large-scale strikes against the Islamic Republic. Still, there’s been a flare-up in low-level fighting across the region in recent days, including a spate of attacks on vessels transiting the critical Strait of Hormuz.</a></blockquote><blockquote class=\"q\"><a class=\"go quote\" data-go=\"x:passage:src:162:01135870831e\">“We are not yet at the point where the narrative of improving supply is enough to overshadow the military flare-ups in the region,” said Florence Schmit, a senior energy strategist at Rabobank. “Flows through Hormuz have improved, yet ships are still being attacked and President Trump is yet again considering plans for another round of extensive strikes on Iran.”</a></blockquote></div></div></details></div></div><div class=\"strip\" data-count=\"5\" style=\"--cols:5\"><div class=\"sf first\" data-k=\"fig:Forecast\"><span class=\"lab\">Forecast</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:p:prop:5\"><span class=\"n v\">30.0%</span></a></span><a class=\"cap go calc\" data-go=\"x:p:prop:5\">How it’s set →</a></div><div class=\"sf\" data-k=\"fig:If Yes\"><span class=\"lab\">If Yes</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:outcome:prop:5:yes\"><span class=\"n v loss\">−$8,872</span></a></span><span class=\"cap\"><span class=\"n loss\">−1.76%</span> of portfolio</span></div><div class=\"sf\" data-k=\"fig:If No\"><span class=\"lab\">If No</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:outcome:prop:5:no\"><span class=\"n v gain\">+$3,799</span></a></span></div><div class=\"sf\" data-k=\"fig:Full impact\"><span class=\"lab\">Full impact</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:swing:prop:5\"><span class=\"n v loss\">−$12,671</span></a></span></div><div class=\"sf\" data-k=\"fig:Volatility\"><span class=\"lab\">Volatility</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:volatility:prop:5\"><span class=\"n v\">±$6,247</span></a></span></div></div><nav class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"outcomes\">Outcomes</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"probability\">Probability</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"assumptions\">Assumptions</button></nav><section data-pane=\"outcomes\"><div class=\"ev-card po-card\" data-k=\"payoff\"><div class=\"card-head\"><span class=\"plab\">P&amp;L by outcome</span><div class=\"rank po-switch\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"When\"><button type=\"button\" data-payoff=\"now\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Today</button><button type=\"button\" data-payoff=\"dated\">On May 18</button></div></div><div class=\"po-pane\" data-payoff-pane=\"now\"><div class=\"po-row\" data-outcome=\"yes\"><div class=\"po-lab\"><span class=\"po-title\">Yes</span><span class=\"po-p n\">30.0%</span></div><div class=\"po-track\">